    "/api/games/{game_uuid}/editions": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Systems this title exists on, with per-core launchers",
        "description": "Every copy of the same title across the caller's accessible libraries, one entry per library row, each carrying its own play options and a launch URL per browser-playable emulator core. Titles are paired by normalised name because Game.igdb_id and Game.slug are both unique, so cross-platform copies cannot share either. Always returns at least the requested game, so a caller never has to special-case a single-system title.",
